---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftQualityClosure
---
Construct a QualityClosure draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Compare implementation evidence and subsequent production observations with the predicted corrective effect. Detect recurrence and unintended consequences, retain unresolved exposure, and require qualified approval before lifting holds or closing the investigation.
